commit 26ff64459c9e0d8bfc9e0b6466344e8fc6b66f40
Author: user <user@user.user>
Date:   Sun Oct 19 13:41:34 2025 +0200

    nn: add eager attention_with_sink op and T11 unit test
    
    - Implement attention_with_sink in candle-nn ops:
      - Compute scores = (q * scale) @ k^T
      - Optional softcapping: tanh(scores/softcap) * softcap
      - Append per-(bh,tq) sink logit as extra column
      - Softmax over [tokens + sink] in fp32, drop sink column
      - Multiply by V to produce output
      - Shape checks and dtype handling
    
    - Add unit test T11 (eager sink correctness):
      - Constructs small q/k/v and sink tensors
      - Baseline explicitly concatenates sink to logits, softmaxes, drops sink, then @V
      - Confirms parity with attention_with_sink (rel err < 1e-6)
    
    Notes:
    - This is the eager/non-FA path per GPT-OSS spec; FA + LSE renorm will come later via flash-attn API returning (O, LSE).

